# SPA fallback for Netlify — mirrors what vercel.json's "rewrites" does
# for Vercel. Netlify already serves an existing static file (icons,
# robots.txt, sw.js, the /assets bundle) before falling through to this
# rule, so a single catch-all is enough; no need to list exclusions.
#
# Only relevant if you deploy to Netlify instead of Vercel — harmless
# and unused otherwise.
/*  /index.html  200
